<!-- Hero Section (Dark Mode) -->
<header class="bg-inverse text-inverse-ink pt-32 pb-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center max-w-4xl">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-6">
            House Rules.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl opacity-90">
            Boring but necessary. Read this so we remain friends.
        </p>
    </div>
</header>

<!-- Content Section -->
<div class="bg-canvas min-h-screen py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-2xl space-y-16">

        <!-- 1. Zero Tolerance (Highlighted) -->
        <section class="bg-surface p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border-l-4 border-accent">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-4 flex items-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 mr-3 text-accent-ink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path></svg>
                1. Professionalism & Respect
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed">
                <strong>The "Look but Don't Touch" Policy:</strong> Our technicians are professionals. While they are selected for their presentation and fitness, they are here to fix your Wi-Fi, not to fulfill fantasies. 
            </p>
            <p class="text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed mt-4">
                Naked Tech maintains a <strong class="text-red-600">Zero Tolerance Policy</strong> regarding harassment. Any inappropriate touching, suggestive comments, or advances toward our staff will result in immediate termination of service and blacklisting from our network. Full fees will still apply.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. Privacy -->
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-4">
                2. Your Data
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
                <strong>The "Nothing to Hide" Promise:</strong> We are 'Naked' with our pricing, not your data. You enter passwords, authentication codes and recovery details yourself. We do not record, photograph, copy, transmit or retain them, and we do not snoop through your folders. If agreed work requires access to sensitive files, we explain why and ask you to remain present. Total transparency works both ways.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. Cancellations -->
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-4">
                3. Cancellations
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
                Because we do not charge a Call-Out Fee for Ivanhoe or Eaglemont, our time is our inventory. Cancellations made less than 4 hours before a booking will incur a <strong>$90 cancellation fee</strong>. We respect your time; please respect ours.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. Liability -->
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-4">
                4. The Fine Print
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-ink/80 leading-relaxed">
                We are good, but we aren't magicians. If your hardware is physically failing (e.g., a dead hard drive), we cannot guarantee data recovery. We strongly recommend backing up your data before we arrive. Naked Tech is not liable for data loss during standard repair procedures.
            </p>
        </section>

    </div>
</div>
